  ButtonBox["TensorNetworkContraction",
   BaseStyle->"Link",
   ButtonData->"paclet:Wolfram/TensorNetworks/ref/TensorNetworkContraction"]],
  "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->"b0000003-0000-0000-0000-000000000003"],
 " and in the runtime cost of evaluation."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->654207663,ExpressionUUID->"e968d889-3111-49ac-940c-0792d9ee852d2"],

